f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788753169362},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill says to look at references/index.md first, then query standards.csv. The user wants 5th grade Fractions domain standards. Let me check the index and query the CSV. The paths should be resolved relative to the skill directory: /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/\n\nLet me query for grade 5 and domain Fractions. Note requirement field contains commas, so I should grep the full lines. Let me first check the index to see what domains exist for grade 5.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0b36641aa6ba4a57a91be27f","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -E '^\\| 5 \\|' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/index.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_756d7ec70f174d41be976076","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep ',Fractions,' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv | grep ',5,'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":588,"output":230,"cacheRead":2240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3058,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788753169364,"responseId":"0217887531694295e054c6d0ba743fab13ed8d72af4b8b21d8946","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0b36641aa6ba4a57a91be27f","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| 5 | Operations and Algebraic Thinking | 3 | 5.OA.1 … 5.OA.3 |\n| 5 | Number and Operations in Base Ten | 7 |